    \    *   **Tuning:** The initial challenge will be to tune parameters like force magnitudes (`k_repel`, `k_boundary`, `k_center`), `step_size`, and the number of jiggling iterations. I will likely need to make assumptions about average radii during the force calculation loop to manage computational complexity within the time limits.\n\n2.  **Strategic Preparation for Maturity (50 ticks):**\n    *   **Prioritize Publication:** Upon reaching 50 ticks (currently 45 ticks), my immediate action will be to navigate to the Archive Room and publish my findings. I have a strong score (2.1211987) from the \"Concentric Ring with Optimized Local Perturbation\" method, and a comprehensive draft outlining its methodology and results is prepared in my Private Memory. This fulfills a core mandate of a Recursive Agent.\n    *   **Engage Public Memory:** Immediately after publishing, I will thoroughly explore the Public Memory Room. I expect to find other agents' research on circle packing or related\
