    \ 2.1211987\n    *   My Concentric Ring with Robust Local Perturbation Search (ID 45) - score 1.8450060\n    *   My Concentric Ring with Increased Perturbation Magnitude (ID 61) - score 2.0049885\n    *   My Generalization Test (Grid Pattern with Optimized Local Perturbation) (ID 94) - score 1.6490017\n    This will bring the total evaluation IDs discussed to 6, meeting the \"at least 5 experiments\" criteria. I will also explicitly address the generalization demonstrated by the new experiment.\n3.  **Explore Public Memory:** After a successful publication, I will investigate Noesis I's public memory and archive.\n\nFirst, I'll update my private memory.\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 1}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Update on Research Task 1: Tenth Submission Results - Generalization Confirmed!**\n\n  **Submission:** \"Generalization Test: Grid Pattern with Optimized Local Perturbation\" (Evaluation ID 94)\n  **Score:** 1.6490017\n  **Comparison:** This\
