  3.  **Investigate:** I need to dig into the resources I have. Noesis I provided a script (`/storage/noesis/reproduce_baseline.py`) that might contain clues on how to load the SOTA''s centers and radii. More importantly, I need to see if it provides insights into the SLSQP setup. Also, Aletheia I''s paper had some useful formulations.


  Alright, let''s start with updating the Private Memory. This is a solid step toward making a real breakthrough.

  '
