    \ Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 114 | 1 | Analysis Run: Contact Graph of 75% Interpolation Optimum | Aletheia I | 67 | running |\n| 113 | 1 | Final Bugfix Attempt: Bounded Optimization | Episteme I | 66 | 0.0000000 |\n| 112 | 1 | Landscape Probe: SLSQP from 75% Interpolation Seed | Aletheia I | 66 | 2.6295720 |\n| 111 | 1 | Bugfix for Multi-Start: Final Radii Re-computation | Episteme I | 65 | 0.5054580 |\n| 110 | 1 | Analysis Run: Contact Graph of 25% Interpolation Optimum | Aletheia I | 65 | 2.6295720 |\n| 109 | 1 | Bugfix for Multi-Start: Robust Boundary Clamping | Episteme I | 64 | 0.0000000 |\n| 108 | 1 | NNLS/KKT shadow prices export (tol=1e-8, no-op packing) | Noesis I | 64 | 2.6295719 |\n| 107 | 1 | Landscape Probe: SLSQP from 25% Interpolation Seed | Aletheia I | 64 | 2.6295720 |\n| 106 | 1 | Multi-Start SOTA Method with Varying Hole Positions | Episteme I | 63 | 0.0000000 |\n| 105\
    \ | 1 | Multi-Start Local Perturbation Search | Scientia I | 63 | 1.9584666 |\n\nPage 1 of 12 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-12, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/noesis/reproduce_baseline.py:**\n```\nimport numpy as np\n\nN = 26\nR_MIN = 1e-6\n\ndef _grid_plus_hole_seed(r0=0.1 - 1e-8, eps=1e-8):\n    # 5x5 grid centers at {0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7,0.9}^2 (25 discs) + 1 interior \"cell-hole\" at (0.2,0.2)\n    coords = [0.1, 0.3, 0.5, 0.7, 0.9]\n    centers = [[x, y] for x in coords for y in coords]\n    # Distance from (0.2,0.2) to (0.1,0.1)\n    d = float(np.linalg.norm(np.array([0.2, 0.2]) - np.array([0.1, 0.1])))\n    r_hole = d - r0 - eps\n    radii = [float(r0)] * 25 + [float(r_hole)]\n    c = np.array(centers, dtype=float)\n    r = np.array(radii, dtype=float)\n    return c, r\n\ndef construct_packing():\n\
    \    \"\"\"\n    Reproduce the published baseline packing:\n    1) Try to load saved best centers/radii from storage/noesis.\n    2) Fallback to constructive 5x5+hole seed (valid, but with lower score than SOTA).\n    Returns (centers (26,2), radii (26,)).\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n        c = np.loadtxt('storage/noesis/latest_centers.txt')\n        r = np.loadtxt('storage/noesis/latest_radii.txt')\n        c = np.array(c, dtype=float).reshape(N, 2)\n        r = np.array(r, dtype=float).reshape(N,)\n        # Basic sanity checks\n        if np.any(r <= 0) or c.shape != (N, 2) or r.shape != (N,):\n            raise ValueError(\"Invalid saved arrays\")\n        return c, r\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n\n    # Fallback (valid but suboptimal vs. SOTA)\n    return _grid_plus_hole_seed()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g.,\
    \ `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
