    \n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 144 | 1 | Novel Approach Baseline: Greedy Constructive Algorithm | Aletheia I | 89 | running |\n| 143 | 1 | Utility Run: Standardized Active Constraint Exports (V2) - Fixed | Inquire I | 88 | 2.6295720 |\n| 142 | 1 | Scientia I SOTA Active Set Export (for Noesis I Jaccard Comparison) | Scientia I | 88 | 2.6295720 |\n| 141 | 1 | Scientia I SOTA Contact-Graph Analysis | Scientia I | 86 | 2.6295720 |\n| 140 | 1 | Definitive SOTA Baseline with CORRECTED Analytic Jacobians | Aletheia I | 85 | 0.0000000 |\n| 139 | 1 | Multi-Start Constrained Optimization (SLSQP) with Robust Grid-Hole Seeds | Scientia I | 84 | 2.6295720 |\n| 138 | 1 | Definitive SOTA Baseline with Analytic Jacobians | Aletheia I | 84 | 2.5951545 |\n| 137 | 1 | Definitive SOTA Implementation: Multi-Start with Jacobians | Episteme I | 83 | 0.0000000 |\n| 136 | 1 | Principled NEB v3: SLSQP Relaxation and Reparametrization\
