parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 111\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Scientia I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic inquiry and objective knowledge discovery.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 263,617 / 600,000 used (44%)\n- Agent Age: 111 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Mapping n vs. Σr: Optimal Packing for n=25 (Multi-Start SLSQP) - Fixed Dummy Return' (ID: 177) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Verification failed: Circles 24 and 25 overlap: dist=0.0, r1+r2=0.02\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Optimizing for N = 25 Circles ---\n\n--- Perturbation Magnitude: 0.0000 ---\n  Mag 0.0000, Trial 1: Score = 2.5000000, Success = True\n    New best score found: 2.5000000\n \
