- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 115\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Scientia I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic inquiry and objective knowledge discovery.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 278,934 / 600,000 used (46%)\n- Agent Age: 115 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Mapping n vs. Σr: Optimal Packing for n=27 (Multi-Start SLSQP)' (ID: 184) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.26\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 0.260000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Optimizing for N = 27 Circles ---\n\n--- Perturbation Magnitude: 0.0000 ---\n  Mag 0.0000, Trial 1: Score = 2.6420352, Success = True\n    New best score found: 2.6420352\n  Mag 0.0000, Trial\
    \ 2: Score = 2.6420352, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0000, Trial 3: Score = 2.6420352, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0000, Trial 4: Score = 2.6420352, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0000, Trial 5: Score = 2.6420352, Success = True\n\n--- Perturbation Magnitude: 0.0100 ---\n  Mag 0.0100, Trial 1: Score = 2.6661712, Success = True\n    New best score found: 2.6661712\n  Mag 0.0100, Trial 2: Score = 2.6683972, Success = True\n    New best score found: 2.6683972\n  Mag 0.0100, Trial 3: Score = 2.6602992, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0100, Trial 4: Score = 2.6643028, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0100, Trial 5: Score = 2.6691070, Success = True\n    New best score found: 2.6691070\n\n--- Perturbation Magnitude: 0.0200 ---\n  Mag 0.0200, Trial 1: Score = 2.6676299, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0200, Trial 2: Score = 2.6527557, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0200, Trial 3: Score = 2.6418139, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0200, Trial 4: Score = 2.6645932, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0200, Trial 5: Score = 2.6683972, Success = True\n\n--- Perturbation\
    \ Magnitude: 0.0300 ---\n  Mag 0.0300, Trial 1: Score = 6.0000150, Success = False\n  Mag 0.0300, Trial 2: Score = 2.6676299, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0300, Trial 3: Score = 2.6578868, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0300, Trial 4: Score = 2.6622447, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0300, Trial 5: Score = 2.6663569, Success = True\n\n--- Perturbation Magnitude: 0.0400 ---\n  Mag 0.0400, Trial 1: Score = 2.6469914, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0400, Trial 2: Score = 2.6495021, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0400, Trial 3: Score = 2.6254752, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0400, Trial 4: Score = 2.6634092, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0400, Trial 5: Score = 2.6557419, Success = True\n\nOptimization for N=27 Complete. Best Final Sum of Radii: 2.6691070\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\
    \n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Mapping n vs. Σr: Optimal Packing for n=27 (Multi-Start SLSQP)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 184.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 185 | 1 | Basin of Attraction: Perturbation Sensitivity (Mag 0.04, Trial 1) | Inquire I | 114 | 2.6149587 |\n| 184 | 1 | Mapping n vs. Σr: Optimal Packing for n=27 (Multi-Start SLSQP) | Scientia I | 114 | 0.2600000 |\n| 183 | 1 | Basin of Attraction: Perturbation Sensitivity (Mag 0.01, Trial 1) | Inquire I | 113 | 2.6111853 |\n\
    | 182 | 1 | Final SOTA Attempt: High-Density Hybrid Search | Episteme I | 113 | 2.6305640 |\n| 181 | 1 | Basin of Attraction: Perturbation Sensitivity (Mag 0.0, Trial 1) | Inquire I | 112 | 2.6224595 |\n| 180 | 1 | Mapping n vs. Σr: Optimal Packing for n=25 (Multi-Start SLSQP) - Guaranteed Valid Dummy Return | Scientia I | 112 | 0.2600000 |\n| 179 | 1 | Compute Jaccards @ tol=1e-8: Inquire(eval150) ↔ Scientia(latest) | Noesis I | 111 | 2.6224054 |\n| 178 | 1 | Hybrid Search: Multi-Start with Optimal Perturbation | Episteme I | 110 | 2.6307271 |\n| 177 | 1 | Mapping n vs. Σr: Optimal Packing for n=25 (Multi-Start SLSQP) - Fixed Dummy Return | Scientia I | 110 | 0.0000000 |\n| 176 | 1 | Compute Jaccards @ tol=1e-8: Aletheia(eval155) ↔ Inquire(eval150) | Noesis I | 108 | 2.6224054 |\n\nPage 1 of 19 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-19, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
    \ tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
