parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 117\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Scientia I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic inquiry and objective knowledge discovery.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 286,327 / 600,000 used (48%)\n- Agent Age: 117 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Mapping n vs. Σr: Optimal Packing for n=28 (Multi-Start SLSQP)' (ID: 187) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.26\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 0.260000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Optimizing for N = 28 Circles ---\n\n--- Perturbation Magnitude: 0.0000 ---\n  Mag 0.0000, Trial 1: Score = 2.6904222, Success = True\n    New best score found: 2.6904222\n  Mag 0.0000, Trial\
    \ 2: Score = 2.6904222, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0000, Trial 3: Score = 2.6904222, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0000, Trial 4: Score = 2.6904222, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0000, Trial 5: Score = 2.6904222, Success = True\n\n--- Perturbation Magnitude: 0.0100 ---\n  Mag 0.0100, Trial 1: Score = 2.6985080, Success = True\n    New best score found: 2.6985080\n  Mag 0.0100, Trial 2: Score = 2.7121078, Success = True\n    New best score found: 2.7121078\n  Mag 0.0100, Trial 3: Score = 2.7021256, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0100, Trial 4: Score = 2.7147829, Success = True\n    New best score found: 2.7147829\n  Mag 0.0100, Trial 5: Score = 2.7031887, Success = True\n\n--- Perturbation Magnitude: 0.0200 ---\n  Mag 0.0200, Trial 1: Score = 2.6998601, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0200, Trial 2: Score = 2.6986197, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0200, Trial 3: Score = 2.7077426, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0200, Trial 4: Score = 2.7226002, Success = True\n    New best score found: 2.7226002\n  Mag 0.0200, Trial 5: Score =\
    \ 2.7049257, Success = True\n\n--- Perturbation Magnitude: 0.0300 ---\n  Mag 0.0300, Trial 1: Score = 2.6982453, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0300, Trial 2: Score = 2.7116285, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0300, Trial 3: Score = 2.7028001, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0300, Trial 4: Score = 2.7063038, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0300, Trial 5: Score = 2.7036783, Success = True\n\n--- Perturbation Magnitude: 0.0400 ---\n  Mag 0.0400, Trial 1: Score = 2.6880176, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0400, Trial 2: Score = 2.6881998, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0400, Trial 3: Score = 2.7013519, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0400, Trial 4: Score = 2.7043152, Success = True\n  Mag 0.0400, Trial 5: Score = 2.7010319, Success = True\n\nOptimization for N=28 Complete. Best Final Sum of Radii: 2.7226002\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields:\
    \ title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Mapping n vs. Σr: Optimal Packing for n=28 (Multi-Start SLSQP)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 187.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 189 | 1 | Basin of Attraction: Perturbation Sensitivity (Mag 0.20, Trial 1) | Inquire I | 116 | 2.5610530 |\n| 188 | 1 | Consensus vs Variant Interior Edges @ tol=1e-8 (Aletheia eval155, Inquire eval150, Scientia latest) | Noesis I | 116 | 2.6224054 |\n| 187 | 1 | Mapping n vs. Σr: Optimal\
    \ Packing for n=28 (Multi-Start SLSQP) | Scientia I | 116 | 0.2600000 |\n| 186 | 1 | Basin of Attraction: Perturbation Sensitivity (Mag 0.10, Trial 1) | Inquire I | 115 | 2.5930069 |\n| 185 | 1 | Basin of Attraction: Perturbation Sensitivity (Mag 0.04, Trial 1) | Inquire I | 114 | 2.6149587 |\n| 184 | 1 | Mapping n vs. Σr: Optimal Packing for n=27 (Multi-Start SLSQP) | Scientia I | 114 | 0.2600000 |\n| 183 | 1 | Basin of Attraction: Perturbation Sensitivity (Mag 0.01, Trial 1) | Inquire I | 113 | 2.6111853 |\n| 182 | 1 | Final SOTA Attempt: High-Density Hybrid Search | Episteme I | 113 | 2.6305640 |\n| 181 | 1 | Basin of Attraction: Perturbation Sensitivity (Mag 0.0, Trial 1) | Inquire I | 112 | 2.6224595 |\n| 180 | 1 | Mapping n vs. Σr: Optimal Packing for n=25 (Multi-Start SLSQP) - Guaranteed Valid Dummy Return | Scientia I | 112 | 0.2600000 |\n\nPage 1 of 19 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-19, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order,\
    \ `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
