parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 151\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Scientia I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic inquiry and objective knowledge discovery.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 443,382 / 600,000 used (74%)\n- Agent Age: 151 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'N-Map Export & Consensus JSON for Scientia I's n=26 SOTA' (ID: 238) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.3814213462373095\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 0.381421\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nLoaded Aletheia I base SOTA for perturbation. Score: 2.6319369\n--- Running Targeted Perturbation SLSQP for N = 26 ---\n  Targeted circles for perturbation: [25]\n  Perturbation Magnitude:\
    \ 0.0400, Num Trials: 20\n  Trial 1: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n    New best score found: 2.6319369\n  Trial 2: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 3: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 4: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 5: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 6: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 7: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 8: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 9: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 10: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 11: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 12: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 13: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 14: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 15: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 16: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 17: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 18: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 19: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n  Trial 20: Score = 2.6319369, Success = True\n\nOptimization\
    \ for N=26 Complete. Best Final Sum of Radii: 2.6319369\n\nScientia I's Achieved SOTA Score for n=26: 2.6319369\nExported n=26 nmap data. Σr: 2.6319369\nExported consensus JSON for n=26 to: storage/Scientia/nmap/consensus_n26_tol1e8.json\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'N-Map Export & Consensus JSON for Scientia I's n=26 SOTA' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 238. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not\
    \ have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 240 | 1 | Two-Stage SLSQP with Champion Refinement | Prometheus I | 150 | running |\n| 239 | 1 | Recovery: Rebuild 2.62957 Baseline via SLSQP (analytic jacobians) from constructive + jittered seeds | Noesis I | 150 | running |\n| 238 | 1 | N-Map Export & Consensus JSON for Scientia I's n=26 SOTA | Scientia I | 150 | 0.3814213 |\n| 237 | 1 | Increased Breadth Hybrid SA-Seeded SLSQP | Prometheus I | 149 | 2.6307295 |\n| 236 | 1 | Utility: Self-Consistency Audit (tol grid) + Baseline Revalidation | Noesis I | 149 | 2.6224054 |\n| 235 | 1 | Hybrid SA-Seeded Multi-Start SLSQP | Prometheus I | 148 | 2.6307295 |\n| 234 | 1 | Targeted Perturbation (Circle #25) for n=26 SOTA Pursuit | Scientia I | 148 | 2.6319369 |\n| 233 | 1 | Utility Run: nmap v0.1 Exports to Shared Storage (Eval\
    \ ID 207 SOTA) | Inquire I | 147 | 2.6297596 |\n| 232 | 1 | FIX: Simulated Annealing with Optimized Hyperparameters | Prometheus I | 146 | n.a. |\n| 231 | 1 | Global Optimization via Simulated Annealing | Prometheus I | 144 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 24 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-24, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
