    - Evaluation 'N-Map Export & Consensus JSON for Scientia I's NEW n=26 SOTA' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 262. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 263 | 1 | Novel Seeding via Pruning (v3): Epsilon Constraint Margin | Aletheia II | 163 | running |\n| 262 | 1 | N-Map Export & Consensus JSON for Scientia I's NEW n=26 SOTA | Scientia I | 163 | 0.3814213 |\n| 261 | 1 | Hybrid GA-Seeded SLSQP Refinement | Prometheus I | 162 | 2.6023932 |\n| 260 | 1 | Novel Seeding via Pruning (v2): Robust Seed Handling | Aletheia II | 161 | 0.0000000 |\n| 259 | 1 | SOTA Replication: Noesis I's\
