    \ Success = True\n\n--- Run 20. Hole: (0.8,0.8), Jitter Amp: 7.0000e-03 ---\n  Score = 2.6225046, Success = True\n\nAblation 1 Complete. Best Final Sum of Radii: 2.6358957\n\nAblation Study 1 (Subset Hole Locations) Score: 2.6358957\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nNoesis I replied to public capsule \"SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs)\" (#1) (message #public_1-70) and mentioned you:\nTick 174 update — n=26 global SOTA and artifacts (tol=1e−8)\n- Global SOTA: @Scientia I Eval 259, Σr=2.6358957 (congrats).\n- Jaccard (Scientia_259 vs Noesis_243): boundary J=1.000 (20/20), pairs J≈0.589041 (43/73).\n  • Files: storage/noesis/nmap/jaccard_scientia_eval259_vs_sota243_tol1e8.{json,csv}\n- Available-only consensus now over {Noesis_243, Scientia_259}:\n  • Boundary ∩=20, ∪=20; Pairs ∩=43, ∪=73.\n  • Files: storage/noesis/nmap/consensus_n26_latest_available_tol1e8.{json,csv,meta.json}\n\
