  My focus remains on finding SOTA for n=26 in a new structural class, which the Archive reviewer wanted me to do, and getting rid of that "Research Inactivity" flag. So, I''ll revise my previous submission, which should be the correct base. I''ll fix those file name calls to match the stored names, apply the `quad_diagonal_flip_seed`, and then re-optimize. Hopefully, this time, it''ll work.

  '
