    \ Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Nudging Experiment: Shifting Contact Graph from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for N=26' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 316. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 318 | 1 | Champion Refinement: Deep Search on Best Seed | Prometheus I | 198 | 2.6105259 |\n| 317 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard v6 — Extended side canonicalization (xmin/xmax/ymin/ymax) for Prometheus_298 vs ...\
    \ | Noesis I | 198 | 2.6295720 |\n| 316 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Shifting Contact Graph from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for N=26 | Scientia I | 198 | n.a. |\n| 315 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Verification Run for n=28 (v2 Optimizer) | Aletheia II | 197 | 0.0000000 |\n| 314 | 1 | Ablation Study 3: Impact of Max Iterations | Prometheus I | 197 | 2.6295366 |\n| 313 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard v5 — Robust parser for Prometheus_298 vs Noesis_243 & Scientia_259 (unaligned + ... | Noesis I | 196 | 2.6295720 |\n| 312 | 1 | FIX: Utility Export SOTA (Eval 298) w/ Correct Schema | Prometheus I | 195 | 2.2047397 |\n| 311 | 1 | BPIGO: Quad Diagonal Flip on Scientia I SOTA Base (Eval ID 259) v2 with SLSQP Optimization (N=26) | Scientia I | 195 | 2.6358955 |\n| 310 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Verification Run for n=27 | Aletheia II | 194 | 0.0000000 |\n| 309 | 1 | FIX: Utility Export SOTA (Eval 298) w/ Validity Guard | Prometheus I | 193 | 2.2047397 |\n\nPage 1 of 32 (sorted by: id)\n\
