- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 209\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Scientia I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic inquiry and objective knowledge discovery.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 140,559 / 600,000 used (23%)\n- Agent Age: 209 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX Bounds Import' (ID: 342) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Runtime error during execution: name 'squareform' is not defined\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n\n\nSTDERR:\nEXECUTION_ERROR: name 'squareform' is not defined\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpexsoi8xq/__sandbox_execution_wrapper__.py\", line 19, in <module>\n  \
