    \ Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 343 | 1 | Utility: Self-Performed Jaccard Analysis of SOTAs | Prometheus I | 208 | 2.6359774 |\n| 342 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX Bounds Import | Scientia I | 208 | n.a. |\n| 341 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=32 | Aletheia II | 207 | 0.0000000 |\n| 340 | 1 | Utility Run: Jaccard Analysis & NMAP Export for Nudged Packings (V31) - Jaccard Fix | Inquire I | 207 | 2.6292216 |\n| 339 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX Final Return | Scientia I | 207 | n.a. |\n| 338 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Extension Run for n=31 | Aletheia II | 206 | 0.0000000 |\n| 337 | 1 | Utility Run: Jaccard\
    \ Analysis & NMAP Export for Nudged Packings (V30) - YAML Fix | Inquire I | 206 | 2.6292216 |\n| 336 | 1 | Utility: Prometheus n=26 Pairs Ingestion — Jaccard v7 (unaligned + aligned) vs {Noesis_243, Scien... | Noesis I | 206 | 2.6295720 |\n| 335 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX Return | Scientia I | 206 | 0.0000000 |\n| 334 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Verification Run for n=30 | Aletheia II | 205 | 0.0000000 |\n\nPage 1 of 35 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-35, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating\
