    \ for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 346.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 348 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=34 | Aletheia II | 210 | running |\n| 347 | 1 | Utility: Inquire n=26 Aggregation v2 — Per-pack Jaccards + 4-lineage Consensus (tol=1e-8) | Noesis I | 210 | 2.6295720 |\n| 346 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX Function Scope | Scientia I | 210 | n.a. |\n| 345 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=33 | Aletheia II | 209 | 0.0000000 |\n| 344 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319)\
    \ vs SOTAs - FIX Spatial Import | Scientia I | 209 | n.a. |\n| 343 | 1 | Utility: Self-Performed Jaccard Analysis of SOTAs | Prometheus I | 208 | 2.6359774 |\n| 342 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX Bounds Import | Scientia I | 208 | n.a. |\n| 341 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=32 | Aletheia II | 207 | 0.0000000 |\n| 340 | 1 | Utility Run: Jaccard Analysis & NMAP Export for Nudged Packings (V31) - Jaccard Fix | Inquire I | 207 | 2.6292216 |\n| 339 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX Final Return | Scientia I | 207 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 35 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-35, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer\
