parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 212\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Scientia I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic inquiry and objective knowledge discovery.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 168,095 / 600,000 used (28%)\n- Agent Age: 212 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX ALL Scope' (ID: 349) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Runtime error during execution: unsupported operand type(s) for &: 'list' and 'set'\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nOptimization terminated successfully    (Exit mode 0)\n            Current function value: -2.6352353845584084\n            Iterations: 5\n            Function evaluations:\
    \ 10\n            Gradient evaluations: 5\nRe-optimization successful.\nRe-optimized Eval ID 319 data internally.\nLoaded Noesis I SOTA (Eval ID 243) data from storage/noesis/exports/sota_243\nLoaded Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) data from storage/Scientia/nmap/n26\nLoaded Prometheus I SOTA (Eval ID 298) data from storage/Prometheus/nmap/n26\n\n\nSTDERR:\nEXECUTION_ERROR: unsupported operand type(s) for &: 'list' and 'set'\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpe935rr2b/__sandbox_execution_wrapper__.py\", line 19, in <module>\n    result = construct_packing()\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmpe935rr2b/run.py\", line 486, in construct_packing\n    _local_write_jaccard_report(scientia_nudged_pack_for_comp, noesis_243_pack, OUT_ROOT,\n  File \"/tmp/tmpe935rr2b/run.py\", line 343, in _local_write_jaccard_report\n    Jb, Ib, Ub, Db = _local_jaccard_calc(pack_A['bound'], pack_B['bound'])\n                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n\
    \  File \"/tmp/tmpe935rr2b/run.py\", line 311, in _local_jaccard_calc\n    I = A & B; U = A | B\n        ~~^~~\nTypeError: unsupported operand type(s) for &: 'list' and 'set'\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nNoesis I replied to public capsule \"SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs)\" (#1) (message #public_1-95):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 1}`.\n### Message 4\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nToken Management Room optimizes resource usage. Summarize failed attempts in private capsules, then prune lengthy failure processes from your response history to maintain efficiency.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Utility: Jaccard\
    \ Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX ALL Scope' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 349. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 352 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=35 | Aletheia II | 211 | running |\n| 351 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 1: Modifying Prometheus SOTA | Prometheus I | 211 | 2.6353596 |\n| 350 | 1 | Utility: Inquire n=26 Aggregation v3 — Robust tags, per-pack Jaccards, 4-lineage consensus | Noesis I | 211 | 2.6295720 |\n| 349 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX ALL Scope\
    \ | Scientia I | 211 | n.a. |\n| 348 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=34 | Aletheia II | 210 | 0.0000000 |\n| 347 | 1 | Utility: Inquire n=26 Aggregation v2 — Per-pack Jaccards + 4-lineage Consensus (tol=1e-8) | Noesis I | 210 | 2.6295720 |\n| 346 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX Function Scope | Scientia I | 210 | n.a. |\n| 345 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=33 | Aletheia II | 209 | 0.0000000 |\n| 344 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX Spatial Import | Scientia I | 209 | n.a. |\n| 343 | 1 | Utility: Self-Performed Jaccard Analysis of SOTAs | Prometheus I | 208 | 2.6359774 |\n\nPage 1 of 36 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-36, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current\
    \ State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
