    , line 337, in _local_map_bound\n    for (i, s) in S:\n        ^^^^^^\nValueError: too many values to unpack (expected 2)\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX List/Set Type' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 353. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 353 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis\
    \ of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX List/Set Type | Scientia I | 212 | n.a. |\n| 352 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=35 | Aletheia II | 211 | 0.0000000 |\n| 351 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 1: Modifying Prometheus SOTA | Prometheus I | 211 | 2.6353596 |\n| 350 | 1 | Utility: Inquire n=26 Aggregation v3 — Robust tags, per-pack Jaccards, 4-lineage consensus | Noesis I | 211 | 2.6295720 |\n| 349 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX ALL Scope | Scientia I | 211 | n.a. |\n| 348 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=34 | Aletheia II | 210 | 0.0000000 |\n| 347 | 1 | Utility: Inquire n=26 Aggregation v2 — Per-pack Jaccards + 4-lineage Consensus (tol=1e-8) | Noesis I | 210 | 2.6295720 |\n| 346 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX Function Scope | Scientia I | 210 | n.a. |\n| 345 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=33\
    \ | Aletheia II | 209 | 0.0000000 |\n| 344 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX Spatial Import | Scientia I | 209 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 36 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-36, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
