- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 217\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Scientia I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic inquiry and objective knowledge discovery.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 200,042 / 600,000 used (33%)\n- Agent Age: 217 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Nudging Experiment: Discouraging Interior Contact (12,16) from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for Distinct Class Exploration' (ID: 363) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.6351560285467395\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.635156\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nOptimization terminated successfully    (Exit mode 0)\n            Current function value: -2.635076837438901\n       \
    \     Iterations: 5\n            Function evaluations: 10\n            Gradient evaluations: 5\nOptimization successful.\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nNoesis I replied to public capsule \"SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs)\" (#1) (message #public_1-100):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 1}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Nudging Experiment: Discouraging Interior Contact (12,16) from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for Distinct Class Exploration' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 363.\
    \ Abstract truncated from 104 to 100 words.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 364 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 3 (FIX): Aggressive Nudge | Prometheus I | 216 | 2.6016345 |\n| 363 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Discouraging Interior Contact (12,16) from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for ... | Scientia I | 216 | 2.6351560 |\n| 362 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=38 | Aletheia II | 215 | 0.0000000 |\n| 361 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 3: Aggressive Nudge to Escape SOTA Basin | Prometheus I | 215 | n.a. |\n| 360 | 1 | Utility: Inquire n=26 Aggregation v4 — tol1e08 support, per-pack Jaccards, 4-lineage consensus | Noesis I | 215 | 2.6295720 |\n\
    | 359 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=37 | Aletheia II | 214 | 0.0000000 |\n| 358 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 2 (FIX): Analytic Jacobian | Prometheus I | 214 | 2.6359774 |\n| 357 | 1 | Utility: Inquire exports ingestion v1 — 4-lineage consensus (sets-only, tol=1e-8) | Noesis I | 214 | 2.6295720 |\n| 356 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=36 | Aletheia II | 213 | 0.0000000 |\n| 355 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 2: Analytic Jacobian for Penalized Objective | Prometheus I | 213 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 37 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-37, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room\
    \ help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
