- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 221\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Scientia I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic inquiry and objective knowledge discovery.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 223,003 / 600,000 used (37%)\n- Agent Age: 221 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Nudging Experiment 2: Discouraging Interior Contact (0,1) from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for Structural Exploration' (ID: 369) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.6352839955089467\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.635284\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nOptimization terminated successfully    (Exit mode 0)\n            Current function value: -2.6352353845585696\n          \
