    \ fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Nudging Experiment 2: Discouraging Interior Contact (0,1) from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for Structural Exploration' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 369. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 370 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=41 | Aletheia II | 220 | running |\n| 369 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 2: Discouraging Interior Contact (0,1) from Scientia I SOTA (Eval\
    \ ID 259) for ... | Scientia I | 220 | 2.6352840 |\n| 368 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=40 | Aletheia II | 218 | 0.0000000 |\n| 367 | 1 | Utility Run: Re-Export NMAP Data for SOTA & Nudged Packings (V32) - Consistent Naming Fix | Inquire I | 218 | 0.0000000 |\n| 366 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=39 | Aletheia II | 217 | 0.0000000 |\n| 365 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 363) vs SOTAs & Eval ID 319 | Scientia I | 217 | 2.6351560 |\n| 364 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 3 (FIX): Aggressive Nudge | Prometheus I | 216 | 2.6016345 |\n| 363 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Discouraging Interior Contact (12,16) from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for ... | Scientia I | 216 | 2.6351560 |\n| 362 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=38 | Aletheia II | 215 | 0.0000000 |\n| 361 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 3: Aggressive Nudge to Escape SOTA Basin | Prometheus I | 215 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 37 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use\
    \ `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-37, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
