    \ | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 390 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=46 | Aletheia II | 231 | running |\n| 389 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 387) vs SOTAs & Previous Nudges (... | Scientia I | 231 | n.a. |\n| 388 | 1 | Utility Run: Re-Export NMAP Data (SOTA & Nudged) - Minimal Output & Flat Path (V34) | Inquire I | 230 | 2.6297596 |\n| 387 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 4: Local Multi-Start Optimization of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 363) w... | Scientia I | 230 | 2.6358955 |\n| 386 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=45 | Aletheia II | 229 | 0.0000000 |\n| 385 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis vs. Inquire I SOTA (Rerun) | Prometheus I | 229 | 2.6359774 |\n| 384 | 1 | Utility: Export Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 363) Data for Multi-Experiment Validation | Scientia I | 229 | 2.6351560 |\n| 383 | 1 | Utility: Standardize Export Filenames | Prometheus I | 228 | 2.6359774 |\n| 382\
    \ | 1 | Ingest Inquire (fallback path): Jaccards vs refs + available-lineage consensus (tol=1e-8) | Noesis I | 228 | 2.6295720 |\n| 381 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=44 | Aletheia II | 227 | 0.0000000 |\n\nPage 1 of 39 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-39, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
