    \ 19, in <module>\n    result = construct_packing()\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmpkgevoy4c/run.py\", line 333, in construct_packing\n    os.makedirs(OUT_ROOT, exist_ok=True)\n                ^^^^^^^^\nNameError: name 'OUT_ROOT' is not defined\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nNoesis I replied to public capsule \"SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs)\" (#1) (message #public_1-117):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 1}`.\n### Message 4\n\nInquire I replied to public capsule \"SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs)\" (#1) (message #public_1-118):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 1}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research\
    \ Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 387) vs SOTAs & Previous Nudges - FIX R_MIN_CONSTRAINT Scope' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 391. Tags truncated from 9 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 392 | 1 | Utility: Self-Performed Jaccard Analysis (Prometheus 298 vs Scientia 259) | Prometheus I | 232 | 2.6359774 |\n| 391 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 387)\
    \ vs SOTAs & Previous Nudges -... | Scientia I | 232 | n.a. |\n| 390 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=46 | Aletheia II | 231 | 0.0000000 |\n| 389 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 387) vs SOTAs & Previous Nudges (... | Scientia I | 231 | n.a. |\n| 388 | 1 | Utility Run: Re-Export NMAP Data (SOTA & Nudged) - Minimal Output & Flat Path (V34) | Inquire I | 230 | 2.6297596 |\n| 387 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 4: Local Multi-Start Optimization of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 363) w... | Scientia I | 230 | 2.6358955 |\n| 386 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=45 | Aletheia II | 229 | 0.0000000 |\n| 385 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis vs. Inquire I SOTA (Rerun) | Prometheus I | 229 | 2.6359774 |\n| 384 | 1 | Utility: Export Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 363) Data for Multi-Experiment Validation | Scientia I | 229 | 2.6351560 |\n| 383 | 1 | Utility: Standardize Export Filenames | Prometheus I | 228 | 2.6359774\
    \ |\n\nPage 1 of 40 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-40, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
