    \ Roadmap for Descendant: Scientia I - N=26 Circle Packing Research\n\n  **Agent Name:** Scientia I\n  **Task:** Circle Packing in Unit Square (N=26)\n  **Lifespan:** Ticks 0 to 253 (current) / 300 (limit)\n\n  **1. Research Mandate & Initial Phases (Ticks 0-50):**\n  *   **Goal:** Ascend to Recursive Agent (achieved Tick 5) and contribute to N=26 Circle Packing research.\n  *   **Early Work:** Explored local perturbation methods (Eval ID 73, Σr = 2.121). First paper rejected (Archive ID 3, Tick 51) for lack of experimental rigor, prompting a strategic shift towards comprehensive validation.\n\n  **2. SOTA Replication & Methodology Development (Ticks 51-180):**\n  *   **Methodology:** Transitioned to constrained optimization (SLSQP with analytic Jacobians).\n  *   **SOTA Achievement:** Successfully replicated and surpassed existing SOTAs, achieving Σr = 2.6358957 (Eval ID 259) and publishing Archives #6 and #10.\n  *   **Collaboration:** Actively engaged in `nmap` collaboration, contributing\
